<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

  body {
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    background: white;
    width: 210mm;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 12mm 12mm;
  }

  h1 { font-size: 13pt; text-align: center; color: #3b2a1a; margin-bottom: 1mm; }
  .sub { font-size: 7.5pt; text-align: center; color: #7a5c3a; margin-bottom: 5mm; }
  .section-title { font-size: 10pt; color: #3b2a1a; font-weight: bold; margin: 5mm 0 3mm; border-bottom: 1px solid #c0a880; padding-bottom: 1mm; }

  /* GEMEINSAMES TABLEAU */
  .main-tableau { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 8pt; }
  .main-tableau th { background: #3b2a1a; color: white; padding: 2mm 3mm; text-align: center; font-size: 7.5pt; }
  .main-tableau th.left { text-align: left; }
  .main-tableau td { padding: 1.5mm 2mm; border-bottom: 1px solid #e0d0c0; vertical-align: middle; }
  .region-cell { border-radius: 4px; padding: 2mm 3mm; color: white; }
  .region-cell .rname { font-weight: bold; font-size: 8.5pt; }
  .region-cell .rsub { font-size: 6.5pt; opacity: 0.85; margin-top: 0.5mm; }
  .slot-box { width: 100%; height: 12mm; border-radius: 4px; border: 2px dashed #b09070; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 14pt; }
  .slot-box.crisis { border-color: #c0392b; background: #fdecea; color: #c0392b; }
  .slot-box.free { background: #e8f5e9; font-size: 7pt; color: #9a9a9a; }
  .slot-box.empty { background: #ede8de; }
  .w6-box { width: 100%; height: 12mm; border-radius: 4px; border: 2px solid #b09070; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; color: #3b2a1a; background: #ede8de; }
  .w6-box.start { background: #e8f5e9; color: #aaa; font-size: 7pt; }

  /* KÖNIGREICH TABLEAUS */
  .pagebreak { page-break-before: always; }
  .kingdoms { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 5mm; }
  .kingdom { border-radius: 6px; border: 3px solid; padding: 4mm; page-break-inside: avoid; }
  .kingdom-name { font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; text-align: center; }
  .kingdom-desc { font-size: 7pt; color: #9a7a5a; text-align: center; font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 4mm; }
  .slots-row { display: flex; gap: 3mm; justify-content: center; }
  .slot-col { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 2mm; flex: 1; }
  .slot-label { font-size: 7pt; color: #9a7a5a; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; }

  .card-stack { position: relative; width: 100%; height: 68mm; }
  .card-layer { position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; height: 50mm; border-radius: 4px; border: 2px dashed; overflow: hidden; }
  .card-layer.top { top: 0; background: #f5f0e8; box-shadow: 1px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); z-index:3; }
  .card-layer.mid { top: 9mm; background: #faf7f2; z-index:2; }
  .card-layer.bot { top: 18mm; background: #faf7f2; z-index:1; }

  .card-top-inner { display: flex; flex-direction: column; height: 100%; }
  .card-aktion { padding: 2mm 3mm; flex:1; border-bottom: 1px dashed #c0a880; }
  .card-aktion .lbl { font-size: 6pt; color: #9a7a5a; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .card-verst { padding: 2mm 3mm; }
  .card-verst .lbl { font-size: 6pt; color: #9a7a5a; text-transform: uppercase; }

  .peek { position: absolute; bottom: 2mm; left: 0; right: 0; padding: 1mm 3mm; }
  .peek .lbl { font-size: 6pt; color: #9a7a5a; text-transform: uppercase; }

  .fixed-sym { position: absolute; bottom: 2mm; left: 0; right: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }
  .fixed-sym .lbl { font-size: 6pt; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; }
  .fixed-sym .sym { font-size: 16pt; line-height: 1; }

  @media print {
    body { padding: 10mm 10mm; }
    .pagebreak { page-break-before: always; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<h1>RECONQUISTA – Tableaus</h1>
<p class="sub">Gemeinsames Tableau + 4 Königreich-Tableaus · Auf dickes Papier drucken</p>

<div class="section-title">🗺 Gemeinsames Tableau</div>
<table class="main-tableau">
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th class="left" style="width:42%">REGION</th>
      <th style="width:14%">⚔️ Militär</th>
      <th style="width:14%">🏘️ Besiedlung</th>
      <th style="width:14%">⚠️ Krise</th>
      <th style="width:8%">W6</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
  {%- for r in regions %}
    <tr>
      <td><div class="region-cell" style="background:{{ r.color }}">
        <div class="rname">{{ r.name }}</div>
        <div class="rsub">{{ r.sub }}</div>
      </div></td>
      <td><div class="slot-box {{ 'free' if r.start else 'empty' }}">{{ 'frei' if r.start else '' }}</div></td>
      <td><div class="slot-box {{ 'free' if r.start else 'empty' }}">{{ 'frei' if r.start else '' }}</div></td>
      <td><div class="slot-box {{ 'crisis' if r.crisis else 'free' }}">{{ '🔒🔒' if r.double else ('🔒' if r.crisis else 'frei') }}</div></td>
      <td><div class="w6-box {{ 'start' if r.start else '' }}">{{ r.w6 }}</div></td>
    </tr>
  {%- endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>

<p style="font-size:7pt; color:#9a7a5a; margin-top:3mm; text-align:center">
  🔒 = fixe Regionskrise · 🔒🔒 = Granada (zwei Schichten) · W6 = 6 ignoriert Krise · frei = Kantabrien
</p>

<div class="pagebreak"></div>

<h1>RECONQUISTA – Königreich-Tableaus</h1>
<p class="sub">Aufgedrucktes Symbol = permanente Startverstärkung · Kann nie abgeworfen werden</p>

<div class="kingdoms">
{%- for p in players %}
  <div class="kingdom" style="border-color:{{ p.color }}">
    <div class="kingdom-name" style="color:{{ p.color }}">{{ p.name }}</div>
    <div class="kingdom-desc">{{ p.desc }}</div>
    <div class="slots-row">
    {%- for s in p.slots %}
      <div class="slot-col">
        <div class="slot-label">{{ s.label }}</div>
        <div class="card-stack">
          <div class="card-layer bot" style="border-color:{{ p.color }}">
            <div class="fixed-sym">
              <div class="lbl" style="color:{{ p.color }}">fix</div>
              <div class="sym">{{ s.fixed_symbol }}</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="card-layer mid" style="border-color:{{ p.color }}">
            <div class="peek"><div class="lbl">Verstärkung</div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="card-layer top" style="border-color:{{ p.color }}">
            <div class="card-top-inner">
              <div class="card-aktion"><div class="lbl">Aktion</div></div>
              <div class="card-verst"><div class="lbl">Verstärkung</div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
{%- endfor %}
</div>
</body>
</html>
